    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not just a \"rut\" though. it's like... every time i get my head above water i just sink again. it's exhausting to keep fighting for a life that just feels like a constant loop of failure and guilt. what's even the point of trying to fix something that's just fundamentally broken?",
